Project "1" -- "0..*" ProjectMember
Project "1" -- "0..*" ProjectInvitation
Project "1" -- "1" ProjectChatRoom
ProjectChatRoom "1" -- "0..*" ProjectChatMessage
User "1" -- "0..*" Project : coordinator
User "1" -- "0..*" ProjectMember
Institution "1" -- "0..*" Project
