}

class BlockedUpload {
  +id: Integer
  +user_id: UUID
  +file_name: CharField
  +reason: CharField
  +ip_address: CharField
  +blocked_at: DateTimeField
}

class SecurityLog {
  +id: Integer
  +user_id: UUID
  +role: CharField
  +action: CharField
  +method: CharField
  +ip_address: CharField
  +path: CharField
  +created_at: DateTimeField
}

AdminPanelSection "1" o-- "0..*" AdminActivityLog
AdminPanelSection "1" o-- "0..*" SecurityLog
AdminPanelSection "1" o-- "0..*" BlockedUpload
AdminPanelSection "1" o-- "0..*" UserStatusHistory
AdminPanelSection "1" o-- "0..*" ContactMessage
AdminPanelSection "1" o-- "0..*" Stats

Admin "1" --> "0..*" AdminActivityLog
Admin "1" --> "0..*" SecurityLog
Admin "1" --> "0..*" UserStatusHistory

note right of Admin
Admin est une specialisation metier de Person
(implementation Django: droits staff/superuser).
end note

note bottom of Corpus
Classe conceptuelle ajoutee pour la section Resources
(corpora_count existe dans Stats).
end note

